    {MD_CAPABILITY_MATRIX_INFO_READ_AREA_01} = Rectangle top left, with white background
    {MD_CAPABILITY_MATRIX_INFO_READ_AREA_02} = Rectangle top middle, with blue background
    {MD_CAPABILITY_MATRIX_INFO_READ_AREA_03} = Rectangle top right, with white background
    {MD_CAPABILITY_MATRIX_INFO_READ_AREA_04} = Rectangle center right, with blue background
    {MD_CAPABILITY_MATRIX_INFO_READ_AREA_05} = Rectangle bottom right, with white background
    {MD_CAPABILITY_MATRIX_INFO_READ_AREA_06} = Rectangle bottom middle, with blue background
    {MD_CAPABILITY_MATRIX_INFO_READ_AREA_07} = Rectangle bottom left, with white background
    {MD_CAPABILITY_MATRIX_INFO_READ_AREA_08} = Rectangle center left, with blue background
    {MD_CAPABILITY_MATRIX_RATING_READ_AREA} = Octagon in the middle of the picture where the rating for each capability is located.

<doc>Here you define the read area for the Value Effort Matrix module.</doc>
<doc>If {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_FILE} is not empty:
    {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_READ_AREA} = Rectangle area of the picture where the background color is red.
    {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_READ_AREA_BIG_BET} = Rectangle area of post-it size within {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_READ_AREA} with text "BIG BET" in the center and directly right to a drawing of a head with a lightbulb
    {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_READ_AREA_NO_BRAINER} = Rectangle area with different background color shading within {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_READ_AREA}, containing the text "NO BRAINER". Take only the area with the shading grade that contains the text, not an area with a different shading grade.
    {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_READ_AREA_WISE_CHOICE} = Rectangle area with different background color shading within {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_READ_AREA}, containing the text "WISE CHOICE". Take only the area with the shading grade that contains the text, not an area with a different shading grade. The top boundary of this rectangle must be aligned exactly with the top boundary of {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_READ_AREA_NO_BRAINER}.

    {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_READ_AREA_NO_BRAINER} = Area with different background color shading within {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_READ_AREA}, containing the text "NO BRAINER". Take only the shaded region that contains the text. Do not use a rectangle unless the shaded region itself is rectangular. Use a shape-conforming marking that follows the outer boundary of the shaded area. If necessary, represent the area as a curved segment or as a polygon with enough points to approximate the curve accurately.
    {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_READ_AREA_WISE_CHOICE} = Area with different background color shading within {MD_VALUE_EFFORT_MATRIX_READ_AREA}, containing the text "WISE CHOICE". Take only the shaded region that contains the text. Do not use a rectangle unless the shaded region itself is rectangular. Use a shape-conforming marking that follows the outer boundary of the shaded area. If necessary, represent the area as a curved segment or as a polygon with enough points to approximate the curve accurately.</doc>

